">seeing</span><span begin="00:23.920" end="00:23.920">, </span><span begin="00:23.920" end="00:24.070">is </span><span begin="00:24.070" end="00:24.580">finally </span><span begin="00:24.580" end="00:25.090">clear</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:25.210" end="00:28.300"><span begin="00:25.210" end="00:25.420">You </span><span begin="00:25.420" end="00:25.710">want </span><span begin="00:25.710" end="00:25.800">to </span><span begin="00:25.800" end="00:26.050">stay</span><span begin="00:26.050" end="00:26.050">, </span><span begin="00:26.050" end="00:26.290">but </span><span begin="00:26.290" end="00:26.440">you </span><span begin="00:26.440" end="00:26.590">know </span><span begin="00:26.590" end="00:27.040">very </span><span begin="00:27.040" end="00:27.310">well </span><span begin="00:27.310" end="00:27.400">I </span><span begin="00:27.400" end="00:27.700">want </span><span begin="00:27.700" end="00:27.790">you </span><span begin="00:27.790" end="00:28.300">gone</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:28.450" end="00:31.780"><span begin="00:28.450" end="00:28.660">Not </span><span begin="00:28.660" end="00:28.870">fit </span><span begin="00:28.870" end="00:29.020">to </span><span begin="00:29.020" end="00:29.090">*</span><span begin="00:29.090" end="00:29.160">*</span><span begin="00:29.160" end="00:29.230">*</span><span begin="00:29.230" end="00:29.300">*</span><span begin="00:29.300" end="00:29.370">*</span><span begin="00:29.370" end="00:29.440">* </span><span begin="00:29.440" end="00:29.680">tread </span><span begin="00:29.680" end="00:29.800">the </span><span begin="00:29.800" end="00:30.340">ground </span><span begin="00:30.340" end="00:30.490">I </span><span begin="00:30.490" end="00:30.640">am </span><span begin="00:30.640" end="00:31.120">walking </span><span begin="00:31.120" end="00:31.780">on</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:32.020" end="00:37.960"><span begin="00:32.020" end="00:32.530">When </span><span begin="00:32.530" end="00:32.650">it </span><span begin="00:32.650" end="00:32.830">gets </span><span begin="00:32.830" end="00:33.340">cold </span><span begin="00:33.340" end="00:34.150">outside </span><span begin="00:34.150" end="00:34.330">and </span><span begin="00:34.330" end="00:34.420">you </span><span begin="00:34.420" end="00:34.810">got </span><span begin="00:34.810" end="00:35.890">nobody </span><span begin="00:35.890" end="00:36.010">to </span><span begin="00:36.010" end="00:37.960">love</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:38.020" end="00:43.330"><span begin="00:38.020" end="00:38.310">You'll </span><span begin="00:38.310" end="00:38.910">understand </span><span begin="00:38.910" end="00:39.100">what </span><span begin="00:39.100" end="00:39.220">I </span><span begin="00:39.220" end="00:39.640">mean </span><span begin="00:39.640" end="00:39.910">when </span><span begin="00:39.910" end="00:39.970">I </span><span begin="00:39.970" end="00:40.450">say </span><span begin="00:40.450" end="00:40.690">there's </span><span begin="00:40.690" end="00:40.840">no </span><span begin="00:40.840" end="00:41.230">way </span><span begin="00:41.230" end="00:41.650">we're </span><span begin="00:41.650" end="00:42.250">gonna </span><span begin="00:42.250" end="00:42.580">give </span><span begin="00:42.580" end="00:43.330">up</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:44.470" end="00:50.410"><span begin="00:44.470" end="00:44.650">and </span><span begin="00:44.650" end="00:44.950">like </span><span begin="00:44.950" end="00:45.070">a </span><span begin="00:45.070" end="00:45.460">little </span><span begin="00:45.460" end="00:45.580">girl </span><span begin="00:45.580" end="00:45.670">that </span><span begin="00:45.670" end="00:46.150">cries </span><span begin="00:46.150" end="00:46.330">in </span><span begin="00:46.330" end="00:46.420">the </span><span begin="00:46.420" end="00:46.960">face </span><span begin="00:46.960" end="00:47.170">of </span><span begin="00:47.170" end="00:47.230">a </span><span begin="00:47.